      "writtenOn": "2026-09-22T12:26:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There are more endpoints that don\u0027t make sense for replicas, e.g. top-menus, even though they in principle might work (without Guice errors). Should we introduce a more generic solution for REST API modules?",
      "revId": "7b4843263dc82359fb432fa248aa069c669cca3b",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b52e9490_0a0c27d3",
        "filename": "java/com/google/gerrit/server/restapi/config/ConfigRestApiModule.java",
